      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how heavy that feels, and I want you to know that you are still here, still alive, and still worthy of care. You don't have to rebuild your whole life overnight; you just need one small step that feels right for you. Let me help you find that step, so you can move forward with your own hands and your own heart. I'm here to listen, to support, and to help you write the next page of your story.",
      "source": "target",
